{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56145","headline":"七真赞 四 · 杜光庭","name":"七真赞 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"灵风扇香华，璨烂开繁衿。\n太真抚云璈，衆仙弹灵琴。\n雅歌三天景，散慧玉华林。\n七祖升福堂，由此步玄音。\n前世福未足，斯书邈难寻。\n信道情不尽，图飞乃反沈。\n太上无爲道，弘之在兆心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56145.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56145","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}